    title: "Deadly strike on Kyiv warehouse prompts evacuations",
    summary: "Ukraine correspondent Dan Johnson reports from Kyiv after the deadly strike, which authorities said killed more than 30 people.",
    preview: "Nearly 400 people have been evacuated after a Russian strike on a warehouse near Kyiv killed at least 37 people, Ukrainian authorities have said. Videos showing the moment of a huge explosion and the plumes of smoke that followed have been shared online. The strike hit a depot storing weapons for Ukraine's military near a residential area. An investigation into the \"terrible negligence on the part of those who stored explosive right next to people\" has begun, President Volodymyr Zelensky said. Ukraine correspondent Dan Johnson reports.",
    body: "Nearly 400 people have been evacuated after a Russian strike on a warehouse near Kyiv killed at least 37 people, Ukrainian authorities have said.\n\nVideos showing the moment of a huge explosion and the plumes of smoke that followed have been shared online.\n\nThe strike hit a depot storing weapons for Ukraine's military near a residential area.\n\nAn investigation into the \"terrible negligence on the part of those who stored explosive right next to people\" has begun, President Volodymyr Zelensky said.\n\nUkraine correspondent Dan Johnson reports.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- KyivUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- War in UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- RussiaUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
